  ('cs_anthony-kennedy_sec2', 'ent_anthony-kennedy', 'narrative', 'U.S. Court of Appeals for the Ninth Circuit', 'This section needs expansion . You can help by adding missing information . ( February 2026 ) On March 3, 1975, upon Reagan''s recommendation, [ 5 ] President Gerald Ford nominated Kennedy to the seat on the United States Court of Appeals for the Ninth Circuit that had been vacated by Charles Merton Merrill . Kennedy was unanimously confirmed by the U.S. Senate on March 20 and received his commission on March 24, 1975. [ 10 ]',
