  ('cs_benny-hinn_sec3', 'ent_benny-hinn', 'narrative', 'Missions', 'Benny Hinn Ministries claims to support 60 mission organizations and several orphanages worldwide, as well as to house and feed over 100,000 children each year and 45,000 children on a daily basis, thanks to his donors. [ 28 ] [ 29 ] Benny Hinn Ministries donated $100,000 for relief supplies for Hurricane Katrina victims in 2005 and $250,000 to the tsunami relief effort in 2007. [ 6 ]',
