VALUES
  ('cs_billie-eilish_sec3', 'ent_billie-eilish', 'narrative', 'Other ventures', 'Media image Much of the media attention surrounding Eilish has revolved around her fashion style, which consists primarily of baggy, oversized clothing. [ 234 ] [ 235 ] [ 34 ] In 2017, she said she likes dressing out of her comfort zone to feel like she grabs the attention of everyone around her. [ 236 ] She tries to be "really different from a lot of people" and dresses opposite to what others wear. [ 225 ] Aiming to "look memorable", Eilish said that she "proved to people that [she''s] more important than they think" and likes being "kind of intimidating, so people will listen up". [ 225 ] [ 237 ] [ 238 ] In 2019, she said: "Over time it''s kind of become a thing, ''Billie Eilish, the creepy, weird, scary girl.'' And I don''t like that. It''s lame. I just don''t want to stay one thing." [ 239 ] In May 2019, Eilish appeared in a Calvin Klein advertisement, where she mentioned that she dresses in baggy clothes to prevent people from judging her body. [ 240 ] [ 241 ] In a March 2020 live show in Miami, as part of the Where Do We Go? Tour, she premiered Not My Responsibility , a short film which addresses her experiences of body shaming. [ 242 ] Not My Responsibility was uploaded to Eilish''s YouTube channel in May 2020. [ 243 ] Eilish was on the cover of the June 2021 issue of British Vogue . The photoshoot by Craig McDean featured her dressed in lingerie, specifically focused on corsets . [ 244 ] [ 245 ] Eilish made her first appearance at the Met Gala in 2021, which had the theme "In America: A Lexicon of Fashion", wearing an Oscar de la Renta gown under the condition that the fashion house would permanently end its use of real fur. [ 246 ] Though the dress was inspired by the original Barbie doll, fashion critics observed its likeness to Golden Age star Marilyn Monroe , who wore a tulle de la Renta gown in the early 1950s. [ 247 ] In early February 2022, Eilish reached 100 million followers on Instagram , making her the youngest person to do so, at 20 years old. S',
   '["clm_wiki_billie-eilish_sec3"]', '["src_wikidata"]',
   'general', 'en', 'assisted', 'kp-027-migration-0027', 'auto_approved', 1,
   80, unixepoch(), 'wikipedia', 381);
UPDATE content_section SET body_markdown = 'William Franklin Graham Jr. was an American evangelist, ordained Southern Baptist minister, and civil rights advocate, whose broadcasts and world tours featuring live sermons became well known in the mid-to-late 20th century. Throughout his career, spanning over six decades, Graham rose to prominence as an evangelical Christian figure in the United States and abroad.', word_count = 54, last_verified_at = unixepoch() WHERE id = 'cs_billy-graham_intro';
