VALUES
  ('cs_blake-shelton_sec2', 'ent_blake-shelton', 'narrative', 'Other ventures', 'Shelton is a partner, along with Ryman Hospitality Properties (the owners of the Grand Ole Opry), in a small chain of restaurants and entertainment complexes called Ole Red. The first Ole Red opened in Shelton''s hometown of Tishomingo, Oklahoma , in September 2017. A Nashville location opened in May 2018. A third location in Gatlinburg opened in March 2019. A fourth location in Orlando, Florida , opened in May 2020. [ 64 ] A smaller location opened inside Nashville International Airport in 2022, and a sixth location opened on the Las Vegas Strip in 2024. [ 65 ]',
   '["clm_wiki_blake-shelton_sec2"]', '["src_wikidata"]',
