VALUES
  ('cs_blake-shelton_sec3', 'ent_blake-shelton', 'legacy', 'Legacy', 'The New York Times described Shelton as "the most important and visible ambassador from Nashville to the American mainstream". [ 66 ] Rolling Stone referred to him as "one of country music''s biggest stars over the past decade." [ 67 ] In Backstory: Blake Shelton , a GAC television special broadcast in 2012, country stars Miranda Lambert stated she "respect[s] him so much as a vocalist", while Trace Adkins said he "is going to be as relevant in this business as he wants to be for as long as he wants to be." [ 68 ] [ 69 ] Country Music Hall of Fame member Brenda Lee has commended both his vocals and songwriting. [ 70 ] [ 71 ] Singer-songwriter Sheryl Crow credits Shelton with inspiring her musically. [ 72 ] Shelton was inducted into the Oklahoma Hall of Fame in 2014, [ 73 ] and made a member of the Grand Ole Opry in 2010. [ 74 ]',
   '["clm_wiki_blake-shelton_sec3"]', '["src_wikidata"]',
