  ('cs_christina-aguilera_sec3', 'ent_christina-aguilera', 'narrative', 'Cultural status', 'Main articles: Cultural impact of Christina Aguilera and Public image of Christina Aguilera Aguilera performing on The Liberation Tour in 2019 Throughout her career, Aguilera has been called a pop icon , [ 359 ] a gay icon , [ 360 ] [ 361 ] a triple threat entertainer , [ 362 ] and a fashion icon . [ 363 ] [ 364 ] She has been ranked among the greatest singers of all time and referred to as the " Voice of a Generation ". [ 365 ] [ 366 ] She has been labeled a " diva " for her stardom and persona, [ 367 ] garnering polarized views, and various comparisons to Mariah Carey . [ 367 ] She has attracted criticism for wearing revealing clothes, [ 368 ] and has been called a sex symbol . [ 339 ] [ 6 ] Aguilera has also been noted for her close affiliation with The Walt Disney Company , being honored as a Disney Legend in 2019. [ 369 ] She has often received media attention for her reinventions. [ 370 ] [ 371 ] In the early 2000s, Aguilera rose to fame as a teen idol with her bubblegum pop eponymous debut album . [ 372 ] Various images she took on included a provocative image following the release of her single " Dirrty ", an old Hollywood image, and a futuristic look. [ 372 ] She was later ranked as one of the most successful artists of the 2000s decade by Billboard . [ 373 ] In the 2010s, Aguilera saw moderate success with her music while spending six seasons as a coach on The Voice . [ 182 ] Aguilera''s personal struggles were often highlighted in the media. [ 374 ] She saw a musical comeback with Liberation (2018). [ 375 ] Throughout her career, Aguilera has faced media attention for her physical appearances with some journalists noting that she has often received body shaming critical comments. [ 376 ] She was named one of the artists who revived teen pop in the late 1990s. [ 48 ] Aguilera has also been a significant figure in helping reshape the "Latin explosion" in the late 1990s and contributed to the Latin pop boom in American music with her album Mi Reflejo (2000),',
   '["clm_wiki_christina-aguilera_sec3"]', '["src_wikidata"]',
   'general', 'en', 'assisted', 'kp-027-migration-0027', 'auto_approved', 1,
   80, unixepoch(), 'wikipedia', 386);
UPDATE content_section SET body_markdown = 'Sir Christopher Edward Nolan is a British and American filmmaker. Known for his Hollywood blockbusters with complex storytelling, Nolan is considered a leading filmmaker of the 21st century. His films have earned over $6 billion worldwide, making him the third-highest-grossing film director of all time. Nolan''s accolades include two Academy Awards, a Golden Globe Award, and two British Academy Film Awards. He was also appointed a Commander of the British Empire (CBE) in 2019 and was knighted in 2024 for his contributions to film.', word_count = 84, last_verified_at = unixepoch() WHERE id = 'cs_christopher-nolan_intro';
