  ('cs_david-fincher_sec3', 'ent_david-fincher', 'narrative', 'Personal life', 'Fincher married model Donya Fiorentino (sister of actress Linda Fiorentino [ 169 ] ) in 1990. They had one daughter together, [ 170 ] before divorcing in 1995. [ 171 ] [ 172 ] Fincher married producer Ceán Chaffin in 1996. [ 173 ]',
