  ('cs_deion-sanders_sec3', 'ent_deion-sanders', 'career', 'Professional football career', 'Atlanta Falcons (1989–1993) More information Height, Weight ... Pre-draft measurables Height Weight 40-yard dash 10-yard split 20-yard split .mw-parser-output .frac{white-space:nowrap}.mw-parser-output .frac .num,.mw-parser-output .frac .den{font-size:80%;line-height:0;vertical-align:super}.mw-parser-output .frac .den{vertical-align:sub}.mw-parser-output .sr-only{border:0;clip:rect(0,0,0,0);clip-path:polygon(0px 0px,0px 0px,0px 0px);height:1px;margin:-1px;overflow:hidden;padding:0;position:absolute;width:1px} 5 ft 11 + 3 ⁄ 4 in (1.82 m) 182 lb (83 kg) 4.27 s 1.53 s 2.56 s Close At the 1989 NFL Scouting Combine , Sanders ran the 40-yard dash with times of 4.27s and 4.29s. [ 57 ] [ 58 ] He was selected in the first round with the fifth overall pick in the 1989 NFL draft by the Atlanta Falcons , [ 59 ] where he played until 1993 . Despite fumbling (and recovering) his first NFL punt return (which was re-kicked on a penalty), Sanders ran for a touchdown on his second return attempt of his first game, a 31–21 loss to the Los Angeles Rams. [ 60 ] In the 1990 season opener, he had an 82-yard pick six in the fourth quarter of the 47–27 win over the Houston Oilers. [ 61 ] In Week 8, against the Cincinnati Bengals, he had a 79-yard punt return for a touchdown in the 38–17 win. [ 62 ] In Week 17, he had a 61-yard pick six against the Dallas Cowboys in a 26–7 win. [ 63 ] He was named NFC Defensive Player of the Week twice in the 1991 season for Weeks 4 and 12. [ 64 ] [ 65 ] In Week 7, against the San Francisco 49ers, he had a 100-yard kickoff return for a touchdown in the 39–34 win. [ 66 ] In Week 12, against the Tampa Bay Buccaneers, he had two interceptions for his first multi-pick game of his professional career. [ 67 ] In Week 16, he had a 48-yard pick six, which was his second interception of the game, in a 26–13 win over the Seattle Seahawks in the final game at Atlanta–Fulton County Stadium . [ 68 ] In Week 2 of the 1992 season, he had a 99-yard kickoff return for a touc',
