  ('cs_denzel-washington_sec2', 'ent_denzel-washington', 'narrative', 'Style and influence', 'Washington has stated that he considers himself a stage actor and not a Hollywood star. [ 83 ] He has also cited James Earl Jones as an influence saying, "He is who I wanted to be." He has also stated that Jones is his "hero" and that his college theater career started because of Jones. [ 84 ] Washington also cited Sidney Poitier as an acting inspiration saying, "He was a mentor, needless to say, an example, a friend". [ 85 ] Washington has influenced and mentored numerous actors such as Chadwick Boseman , [ 86 ] Mahershala Ali , [ 87 ] Michael B. Jordan , [ 88 ] Jamie Foxx , [ 89 ] Will Smith , Jake Gyllenhaal , [ 90 ] Austin Butler , [ 91 ] and Glen Powell . [ 92 ]',
   '["clm_wiki_denzel-washington_sec2"]', '["src_wikidata"]',
