  ('cs_diane-sawyer_sec2', 'ent_diane-sawyer', 'narrative', 'Personal life', 'Sawyer dated future politician Bill Bradley as a college student. [ 30 ] She was in relationships with Frank Gannon, aide to President Richard Nixon , as well as American diplomat Richard Holbrooke , and actor Warren Beatty . [ 31 ] [ 32 ] On April 29, 1988, she married film and theatre director, producer, and actor Mike Nichols . Nichols had two daughters and a son from previous marriages. He died on November 19, 2014, at the age of 83. [ 33 ] The "List of The World''s 100 Most Powerful Women" in Forbes magazine reported that, between June 2005 and June 2008, Sawyer made approximately $12 million, [ 24 ] solely from entertainment income.',
   '["clm_wiki_diane-sawyer_sec2"]', '["src_wikidata"]',
