  ('cs_dua-lipa_sec2', 'ent_dua-lipa', 'narrative', 'Fashion ventures', 'Lipa has been the cover girl of several magazines. [ 151 ] She signed with Next Models . [ 152 ] [ 153 ] [ 154 ] She was in the cover of the "Boom Boom Tick" editorial for Elle '' s January 2016 issue. [ 155 ] [ 156 ] In April 2016 she was again in an editorial of Elle . [ 5 ] [ 157 ] She was on a supplemental cover of British Vogue in November 2016. [ 158 ] [ 159 ] She starred an editorial for the January 2017 issue of V . [ 160 ] In the same month, she was on the cover for issue 102 of Clash . [ 161 ] [ 162 ] In March 2017, she became a global ambassador for the American shoe company, Foot Locker , to present women''s collections offered by the brand. [ 163 ] [ 164 ] She was in an editorial for Interview released in April 2017. [ 165 ] [ 166 ] She modelled for an editorial of Paper , published on 6 June 2017. [ 167 ] [ 168 ] She was featured in the summer 2017 issue of Teen Vogue in an editorial titled "Fine Tuned". [ 169 ] [ 170 ] She was in an editorial for June 2017 issue of InStyle . [ 171 ] [ 172 ] She was in an editorial called "Game Changers" for Fall 2017 issue of V . [ 173 ] [ 174 ] She was in the Fall/Winter 2017–18 advertising campaign of the Italian brand Patrizia Pepe, [ 175 ] [ 176 ] as well as recorded a cover of the song " Bang Bang (My Baby Shot Me Down) " (1966) as a soundtrack for the commercial for the said campaign. [ 177 ] She was on the cover and appeared in an editorial for November 2017 issue of Evening Standard . [ 178 ] [ 179 ] In the same month, she released her second collaboration with the brand Foot Locker for autumn/winter collection. [ 180 ] [ 181 ] In January 2018, she was part of a promotional clip for an Adidas Originals campaign called "Original Is Never Finished". [ 182 ] She was on the cover of April 2018 issue of Teen Vogue . [ 183 ] She was on one of the covers for issue 113 of V entitled "The Music Issue", published in May 2018 as a limited edition. [ 184 ] [ 185 ] She partnered with the fashion brand Nyden on a project to',
