  ('cs_ellen-degeneres_sec3', 'ent_ellen-degeneres', 'narrative', 'Personal life', 'DeGeneres has been diagnosed with ADHD and OCD . [ 106 ] Wealth and popularity Forbes estimated DeGeneres''s 2020 earnings at US$84 million and her net worth at $370 million, [ 107 ] making her the 12th-highest-paid entertainer in the world. [ 108 ] In 2015, she was named the 50th-most-powerful woman in the world by Forbes [ 109 ] and came second on the World Pride Power list. [ 110 ] As of November 2023 [ update ] , she had 75 million followers on Twitter and 139 million followers on Instagram , making her the 14th most-followed user on Twitter and the 32nd most-followed user on Instagram . In May 2025, DeGeneres was listed in the Sunday Times Rich List with a net worth of £363 million. [ 111 ] DeGeneres is a fan of the National Football League , but does not follow one team; she has shown support for the New Orleans Saints and the Green Bay Packers , [ 112 ] [ 113 ] and she attended a 2011 Saints practice session dressed as Packers Hall of Famer Don Hutson . [ 114 ] Sexual orientation and relationships de Rossi (left) and DeGeneres in September 2012 In 1997, DeGeneres came out as a lesbian. The disclosure of her sexual orientation sparked intense interest by American tabloids. [ 115 ] The contentiousness of the media coverage stunted her professional career and left her "mired in depression". [ 115 ] [ 116 ] In her book Love, Ellen , DeGeneres''s mother Betty describes being initially shocked when DeGeneres came out, but she has since become one of her strongest supporters; Betty is also an active member of PFLAG and spokesperson for the Human Rights Campaign ''s Coming Out Project. The same year she came out, DeGeneres started a romantic relationship with actress Anne Heche that lasted until August 2000. [ 117 ] From 2000 to 2004, DeGeneres maintained a close relationship with photographer Alexandra Hedison . [ 118 ] The couple appeared on the cover of The Advocate after their separation had already been announced to the media. [ 119 ] Since 2004, DeGeneres has b',
   '["clm_wiki_ellen-degeneres_sec3"]', '["src_wikidata"]',
