  ('cs_emmitt-smith_sec2', 'ent_emmitt-smith', 'career', 'Professional career', 'Dallas Cowboys 1990 season In the 1990 NFL draft , the Dallas Cowboys considered drafting linebacker James Francis with their first round selection, but after he was taken by the Cincinnati Bengals , the Cowboys focused on improving their running game when Smith started dropping, because despite his collegiate success, some NFL teams still felt that Smith was too small and slow for the pro game. [ 45 ] The Cowboys traded up with the Pittsburgh Steelers moving from the 21st to the 17th pick, in exchange for a third round draft choice (#81- Craig Veasey ), to select Smith in the first round. [ 46 ] [ 47 ] He missed all of the preseason after having the longest holdout by a rookie in franchise history. [ 48 ] After a quiet start to his professional career, he scored his first NFL touchdown on a two-yard carry in Week 3 against Washington. [ 49 ] In Week 5, against the Tampa Bay Buccaneers, he had 23 carries for 121 yards and a touchdown for his first game going over 100 yards in the 14–10 victory. [ 50 ] In Week 11, he had four receptions for 117 yards in a 24–21 win over the Los Angeles Rams. [ 51 ] In Week 12, he had 23 carries for 132 yards and two touchdowns against Washington in a 27–17 victory. [ 52 ] He had 24 carries for 103 yards and four touchdowns in a 41–10 victory over the Phoenix Cardinals in Week 15. [ 53 ] He started 15 games and rushed for 937 yards and 11 touchdowns, while being named NFL Offensive Rookie of the Year and receiving Pro Bowl honors. [ 54 ] He was named to the 1990 NFL All-Rookie Team. [ 55 ] Smith''s #22 Cowboys jersey exhibited at the Pro Football Hall of Fame 1991 season In Week 4 of the 1991 season, Smith had 23 carries for 182 yards and two touchdowns in a 17–9 win over the Phoenix Cardinals. [ 56 ] At the time, the 182 yards marked a career high for Smith. [ 57 ] In Week 10, he had three rushing touchdowns against the Phoenix Cardinals in a 27–7 win. [ 58 ] In Week 17 against the Atlanta Falcons, he had 32 carries for 160 yards and',
