  ('cs_eric-church_sec3', 'ent_eric-church', 'narrative', 'Musical styles', 'Church''s style has been described as country rock , outlaw country , and southern rock . Church''s influences include Hank Williams Jr. , Merle Haggard , Little Feat , The Band , Kris Kristofferson , The Grateful Dead , Ray Wylie Hubbard and Waylon Jennings . [ 64 ] Church has also said that many hard rock and heavy metal bands influenced his music, including Metallica and AC/DC . [ 65 ]',
