  ('cs_henry-ford_sec1', 'ent_henry-ford', 'narrative', 'Marriage and family', 'Ford married Clara Jane Bryant (1866–1950) on April 11, 1888, and supported himself by farming and running a sawmill . [ 16 ] They had one child, Edsel Ford (1893–1943). [ 17 ]',
