  ('cs_james-watson_sec3', 'ent_james-watson', 'narrative', 'Awards and honors', 'Watson with the Othmer Gold Medal in 2005 Watson won numerous awards including: .mw-parser-output .div-col{margin-top:0.3em;column-width:30em}.mw-parser-output .div-col-small{font-size:90%}.mw-parser-output .div-col-rules{column-rule:1px solid #aaa}.mw-parser-output .div-col dl,.mw-parser-output .div-col ol,.mw-parser-output .div-col ul{margin-top:0}.mw-parser-output .div-col li,.mw-parser-output .div-col dd{page-break-inside:avoid;break-inside:avoid-column} 1959 - Eli Lilly Award in Biological Chemistry [ 2 ] 1960 - Albert Lasker Award for Basic Medical Research [ 135 ] 1962 - Nobel Prize in Physiology or Medicine [ 2 ] 1977 - Presidential Medal of Freedom [ 136 ] 1985 - EMBO Membership [ 137 ] 1986 - Golden Plate Award of the American Academy of Achievement [ 138 ] 1993 - Copley Medal of the Royal Society [ 139 ] [ 140 ] 1997 - National Medal of Science [ 141 ] 2000 - Liberty Medal [ 142 ] 2001 - Benjamin Franklin Medal for Distinguished Achievement in the Sciences [ 143 ] 2002 - Gairdner Foundation International Award [ 144 ] 2002 - Honorary Knight Commander of the Order of the British Empire (KBE) [ 145 ] 2005 - Honorary Member of Royal Irish Academy [ 146 ] 2005 - Othmer Gold Medal [ 147 ] [ 148 ] 2008 - CSHL Double Helix Medal Honoree [ 149 ] 2010 - Honorary Fellow, the Hastings Center , an independent bioethics research institution [ 150 ] 2011 - Irish America Hall of Fame, inducted March 2011 [ 151 ] 2011 - John J. Carty Award in molecular biology from the National Academy of Sciences [ 152 ] Honorary degrees received DSc, University of Chicago , US, 1961 [ 153 ] DSc, Indiana University , US, 1963 [ 154 ] LLD, University of Notre Dame , US, 1965 [ 155 ] DSc, Long Island University (CW Post), US, 1970 [ 156 ] DSc, Adelphi University , US, 1972 [ 157 ] DSc, Brandeis University , US, 1973 [ 158 ] DSc, Albert Einstein College of Medicine , US, 1974 [ 159 ] DSc, Hofstra University , US, 1976 [ 160 ] DSc, Harvard University , US, 1978 [ 161 ] DSc, Rockefeller Univ',
