  ('cs_jason-aldean_sec2', 'ent_jason-aldean', 'narrative', 'Personal life', 'Aldean married Jessica Ann Ussery on August 4, 2001. [ 52 ] Together, the couple have a daughter born in 2003, and another born in 2007. [ 52 ] On September 30, 2012, Aldean admitted to having "acted inappropriately at a bar" [ 53 ] with former American Idol contestant Brittany Kerr, responding to reports linking her and Aldean. In a statement, Kerr said she had suffered "a lapse in judgment" and "would like to sincerely apologize to everyone that has been affected by this." [ 54 ] Aldean filed for divorce on April 26, 2013, citing irreconcilable differences and listing the filing date as the formal separation date. [ 52 ] Aldean and Kerr began dating and made their first public appearance as a couple at the 2014 CMT Awards. [ 55 ] They announced their engagement in September 2014 [ 56 ] and were married on March 21, 2015. [ 57 ] Their son Memphis was born on December 1, 2017. [ 58 ] Their daughter Navy was born in early 2019. [ 59 ] In August 2022, Brittany Aldean posted an Instagram video in which she stated, "I''d really like to thank my parents for not changing my gender when I went through my tomboy phase. I love this girly life", followed by a longer post in which she stated an opposition to trans existence. [ 60 ] [ 61 ] In response, Aldean''s public relations firm The GreenRoom dropped him after 17 years as a client on September 1. [ 62 ] Jason Aldean''s Kitchen + Rooftop Bar in Gatlinburg, Tennessee in 2023. Aldean owns part of a hunting company, Buck Commander, in partnership with former Major League Baseball (MLB) players Adam LaRoche , Ryan Langerhans , and Tom Martin ; Willie Robertson of Duck Dynasty ; and fellow country singers Luke Bryan and Tyler Farr . [ 63 ] He also owns Jason Aldean''s Kitchen + Rooftop Bar, which opened in Nashville in 2018. [ 64 ] A second location in Gatlinburg opened in 2023, [ 65 ] a third location in Pittsburgh opened in March 2024, [ 66 ] and a fourth location in Las Vegas opened in December 2024. [ 67 ] He also is a co-ow',
