  ('cs_jay-leno_sec3', 'ent_jay-leno', 'narrative', 'Influences', 'Leno''s comedic influences include Johnny Carson , Robert Klein , Alan King , David Brenner , Mort Sahl , George Carlin , [ 76 ] Don Rickles , [ 77 ] Bob Newhart , [ 78 ] and Rodney Dangerfield . [ 79 ] Dennis Miller and Jerry Seinfeld have credited Leno as their inspiration. [ 80 ]',
