  ('cs_jennifer-lawrence_sec2', 'ent_jennifer-lawrence', 'narrative', 'Artistry and public image', 'In 2012, the review website IndieWire described Lawrence''s off-screen persona as "down-to-earth, self-deprecating, unaffected". [ 144 ] Adam McKay, who directed Lawrence in Don''t Look Up , considered her "a strong, funny truth-teller". "No one has more beautiful anger than Jen," McKay said. "When she unleashes, it is a sight to behold." [ 115 ] An IGN writer described her as a "sharp", "funny" and "quirky" actress who liked to "stay grounded" despite her considerable success. [ 145 ] Lawrence has said she finds acting "stupid" in comparison to life-saving professions like doctors, and therefore does not believe in being "cocky" about her accomplishments. [ 146 ] Lawrence in 2014 In 2012, Rolling Stone called Lawrence "the most talented young actress in America". [ 7 ] Her The Hunger Games co-star Donald Sutherland found her an "exquisite and brilliant actor" and favorably compared her craft to that of Laurence Olivier . [ 147 ] David O. Russell, who directed Lawrence in Silver Linings Playbook , American Hustle and Joy , has said that her acting "is effortless and she makes it look easy". [ 148 ] She has played roles in both high-profile, mainstream productions and low-budget independent films, and appeared in a range of film genres. [ 145 ] Lawrence did not study acting and has not been involved in professional theater. [ 15 ] She bases her acting approach on her observations of people around her. [ 149 ] Lawrence said in 2010 that she did not "invest any of my real emotions" or take home any of her characters'' pain. She went on to say that "I don''t even take it to craft services " and has never shared her characters'' experiences, relying instead on her imagination: "I can''t go around looking for roles that are exactly like my life." Lawrence also added "If it ever came down to the point where, to make a part better, I had to lose a little bit of my sanity, I wouldn''t do it. I would just do comedies." [ 15 ] Lawrence has become one of the world''s highest-pa',
