VALUES
  ('cs_jimmy-fallon_sec2', 'ent_jimmy-fallon', 'narrative', 'Influences', 'Fallon told David Steinberg on the Showtime series Inside Comedy that as a child he and his sister would imitate Steve Martin and Dan Aykroyd ''s "Wild and Crazy Guys" routines from Saturday Night Live , and that he listened to comedy records, learning to imitate Rodney Dangerfield from them. [ 75 ] In 2009 he spoke on the influence of Monty Python when he appeared in the television documentary, Monty Python: Almost the Truth (Lawyers Cut) . [ 76 ]',
