  ('cs_joe-rogan_sec3', 'ent_joe-rogan', 'narrative', 'Personal life', 'Family Rogan married Jessica Ditzel, a former cocktail waitress, in 2009. [ 14 ] [ 174 ] They have two daughters, who were born in 2008 and 2010. Rogan is also the stepfather or adopted father of Ditzel''s daughter from a previous relationship. [ 175 ] [ 176 ] In 2008, they moved to Gold Hill, Colorado , but returned to Southern California four months later when Ditzel became pregnant. [ 177 ] They settled in Bell Canyon, California , where Rogan had lived on and off since 2003. In 2018, they purchased a new home in the area for almost $5 million . [ 178 ] [ 179 ] [ 180 ] [ 181 ] In 2020, the family moved into a $14 million home on Lake Austin in Austin, Texas . [ 182 ] In October 2019, he revealed that he is a second cousin of My Chemical Romance members Gerard Way and Mikey Way , although he has never met them. [ 183 ] Martial arts Rogan became interested in jiu-jitsu after watching Royce Gracie fight at UFC 2: No Way Out in 1994. [ 42 ] In 1996, he began training in Brazilian jiu-jitsu under Carlson Gracie at his school in Los Angeles, California. [ 23 ] He is a black belt under Eddie Bravo ''s 10th Planet Jiu-Jitsu , a style of no-gi Brazilian jiu-jitsu, [ 184 ] and a black belt in gi Brazilian jiu-jitsu under Jean Jacques Machado . [ 185 ] Religion Rogan was raised Catholic and attended Catholic school for first grade. He later abandoned organized religion and called himself agnostic. [ 186 ] However, when questioned by Zahi Hawass in 2025, he affirmed his belief in religion, having softened his previous stance in recent years. [ 187 ] According to Christian apologist Wesley Huff , Rogan attends church every Sunday. [ 188 ] Rogan has confirmed this and as of 2025 attends church services regularly. [ 189 ] Health Rogan has vitiligo on his hands and feet. [ 14 ] Altercations In June 2025, fitness influencer Liver King was arrested after making consecutive violent threats against Rogan on social media. [ 190 ] [ 191 ]',
