  ('cs_john-deere_sec1', 'ent_john-deere', 'narrative', 'Non-serviceability by owners or third parties', 'Late model John Deere farm equipment has been criticized for being impossible to be serviced or repaired by owners or third parties. Only John Deere has access to computer code required for this and to accept non-John-Deere replacement parts. Remote locking by the manufacturer may also be possible. This effectively makes the equipment unusable without the continued involvement of John Deere. [ 69 ] It was reported that during the 2022 Russian invasion of Ukraine , Russian troops stole Ukrainian farm equipment and took it back to Russia, but that the dealers who owned the equipment locked it remotely. [ 70 ] John Deere''s license covering the internal software on tractor control computers does not allow users or independent mechanics to modify the software. [ 71 ] [ 72 ] This prevents repairs by farmers and creates a monopoly for John Deere dealerships. [ 73 ] John Deere claims user repair is forbidden by the Digital Millennium Copyright Act , through bypassing of digital rights management . [ 74 ] Groups including the Electronic Frontier Foundation have criticised this activity, being contrary to the right to repair . [ 75 ] [ 76 ] Some farmers use Ukrainian versions of John Deere software to circumvent restrictions on repair. [ 77 ] [ 78 ] [ failed verification ] In February 2022, the US Senate introduced a bill to allow farmers to perform their own repairs. [ 79 ] [ 80 ] As of April 2022 [ update ] , right-to-repair bills had been introduced in 26 states. [ 81 ] In January 2023, John Deere signed a memorandum of understanding (MOU) with the American Farm Bureau Federation (AFBF) in which the company agreed to allow farmers and independent repair shops to purchase access to John Deere software, manuals, and other information needed to fix John Deere equipment. [ 82 ] Walter Schweitzer, President of the Montana Farmers Union, expressed skepticism about the agreement, pointing out that the private-sector MOU lacks a legal enforcement mechanism and allows the company ',
   '["clm_wiki_john-deere_sec1"]', '["src_wikidata"]',
   'general', 'en', 'assisted', 'kp-027-migration-0027', 'auto_approved', 1,
