  ('cs_jon-stewart_sec3', 'ent_jon-stewart', 'narrative', 'Influences', 'Stewart has said his influences include George Carlin , [ 164 ] Lenny Bruce , [ 165 ] Woody Allen , [ 39 ] David Letterman , [ 166 ] Steve Martin , [ 167 ] and Richard Pryor . [ 11 ] Among comedians who say they were influenced by Stewart are Stephen Colbert , [ 18 ] John Oliver , [ 168 ] Hasan Minhaj , [ 169 ] Samantha Bee , [ 170 ] Larry Wilmore , [ 171 ] Bassem Youssef , [ 172 ] Seth Meyers , [ 173 ] Trevor Noah , [ 174 ] Desi Lydic , [ 175 ] and Jordan Klepper . [ 176 ]',
