VALUES
  ('cs_joni-mitchell_sec3', 'ent_joni-mitchell', 'legacy', 'Legacy and impact', 'Mitchell''s approach to music struck a chord with many female listeners. In an era dominated by the stereotypical male rock star, she presented herself as "multidimensional and conflicted ... allow[ing] her to build such a powerful identification among her female fans". [ 149 ] Mitchell asserted her desire for artistic control throughout her career, and still holds the publishing rights for her music. She has disclaimed the notion that she is a "feminist"; in a 2013 interview she rejected the label, stating, "I''m not a feminist. I don''t want to get a posse against men. I''d rather go toe-to-toe; work it out." [ 150 ] David Shumway notes that Mitchell "became the first woman in popular music to be recognized as an artist in the full sense of that term.... Whatever Mitchell''s stated views of feminism, what she represents more than any other performer of her era is the new prominence of women''s perspectives in cultural and political life." [ 149 ] Mitchell''s work has had a significant influence on many other artists, including Taylor Swift , [ 151 ] Björk , [ 151 ] Prince , [ 152 ] Ellie Goulding , Harry Styles , [ 153 ] Corinne Bailey Rae , Gabrielle Aplin , [ 154 ] Mikael Åkerfeldt from Opeth , [ 155 ] Pink Floyd ''s David Gilmour , [ 156 ] Marillion members Steve Hogarth and Steve Rothery , [ 157 ] [ 158 ] their former vocalist and lyricist Fish , [ 159 ] Paul Carrack , [ 160 ] Haim , [ 161 ] Lorde , [ 162 ] Clairo [ 163 ] and Gretta Ray . [ 164 ] Madonna has also cited Mitchell as the first female artist that really spoke to her as a teenager; "I was really, really into Joni Mitchell. I knew every word to Court and Spark ; I worshipped her when I was in high school. Blue is amazing. I would have to say of all the women I''ve heard, she had the most profound effect on me from a lyrical point of view." [ 165 ] Several artists have had success covering Mitchell''s songs. Judy Collins ''s 1967 recording of "Both Sides, Now" reached No. 8 on Billboard charts and wa',
   '["clm_wiki_joni-mitchell_sec3"]', '["src_wikidata"]',
   'general', 'en', 'assisted', 'kp-027-migration-0027', 'auto_approved', 1,
   90, unixepoch(), 'wikipedia', 378);
UPDATE content_section SET body_markdown = 'J. P. Morgan (1837–1913) was an American banking tycoon.', word_count = 9, last_verified_at = unixepoch() WHERE id = 'cs_jp-morgan_intro';
UPDATE content_section SET body_markdown = 'Julia Fiona Roberts is an American actress. Known for her leading roles across several genres, she has received various accolades, including an Academy Award, a British Academy Film Award, and three Golden Globes. She became known for playing charming and relatable characters in romantic comedies and blockbusters, before expanding into dramas, thrillers, and independent films.', word_count = 55, last_verified_at = unixepoch() WHERE id = 'cs_julia-roberts_intro';
