  ('cs_katie-couric_sec2', 'ent_katie-couric', 'narrative', 'Public image', 'Couric has been dubbed "America''s Sweetheart," largely due to her co-anchor role for 15 years on The Today Show . [ 105 ] On May 12, 2003, Couric guest-hosted The Tonight Show with Jay Leno as part of a swap campaign, and had 45 percent more viewers than on other nights. She has been the only guest host used by Jay Leno on either The Tonight Show or his short-lived The Jay Leno Show . Leno filled in for her on Today that same day. CNN and the New York Daily News noted that instead of using Leno''s regular solid desk, "workers cut away the front of her desk to expose her legs while she interviewed American Idol judge Simon Cowell and Austin Powers star Mike Myers ". [ 106 ]',
