  ('cs_kelly-rowland_sec2', 'ent_kelly-rowland', 'narrative', 'Personal life', 'In December 2013, Rowland announced her engagement to Tim Weatherspoon during an appearance on The Queen Latifah Show . [ 176 ] They began dating circa 2009, [ 177 ] after first meeting and becoming friends in the early 2000s, [ 178 ] when they were introduced by Rowland''s Destiny''s Child bandmate Michelle Williams . [ 179 ] They were married in Costa Rica on May 9, 2014, [ 180 ] and have two sons together, born in 2014 and 2021. [ 181 ] [ 182 ] In June 2020, Rowland revealed she had reconciled with her estranged father, Christopher Lovett. [ 183 ]',
