  ('cs_kendrick-lamar_sec1', 'ent_kendrick-lamar', 'career', 'Career', '2003–2008: Beginnings Lamar began his career while he attended Centennial High School . During high school, Lamar adopted the stage name K.Dot and began freestyling and battle rapping at school. [ 25 ] His performances caught the attention of fellow student Dave Free , who traveled from Inglewood to watch him rap. [ 25 ] They quickly formed a friendship over their love of hip-hop and the television sitcom Martin . [ 25 ] They recorded music together at Free''s makeshift garage studio and at his older brother''s Hyde Park apartment. [ 25 ] Lamar''s earliest performances were held at a "super hood" comedy club and behind a tattoo parlor. [ 25 ] Free was his hype man during that time, while his older brother was his manager and disc jockey. [ 25 ] Lamar recorded five mixtapes throughout the 2000s ; his first, Youngest Head Nigga in Charge (Hub City Threat: Minor of the Year) , was released in 2004 or 2005, through Konkrete Jungle Musik. [ 26 ] The mixtapes primarily consisted of freestyles over the production of popular hip-hop songs . [ 26 ] In a series of retrospective reviews for Rolling Stone , Mosi Reeves complimented Lamar''s "unerring" sense of rhythm and timing found in Hub City Threat: Minor of the Year , but criticized his "clumsy" lyricism and that his flow was "overly beholden to ... Jay-Z and Lil Wayne". [ 26 ] Free, who was working as a computer technician , introduced the mixtape to record producer Anthony "Top Dawg" Tiffith while attempting to repair his computer. [ 27 ] Tiffith was impressed with Lamar''s burgeoning abilities and invited him to partake in an audition process for entry into his newly established independent record label , Top Dawg Entertainment (TDE). [ 27 ] During his audition, Lamar freestyled for Tiffith and record executive Terrence "Punch" Henderson for two hours, a strategy that impressed Henderson but bewildered Tiffith. [ 5 ] [ 28 ] He was offered a recording contract by TDE in 2005, joining Jay Rock as the label''s first signin',
   '["clm_wiki_kendrick-lamar_sec1"]', '["src_wikidata"]',
   'general', 'en', 'assisted', 'kp-027-migration-0027', 'auto_approved', 1,
   20, unixepoch(), 'wikipedia', 348);
