  ('cs_kim-kardashian_sec3', 'ent_kim-kardashian', 'narrative', 'Personal life', 'Relationships In 2000, at 19 years old, Kardashian eloped with music producer Damon Thomas . [ 222 ] Thomas filed for divorce in 2003. Kardashian later blamed their separation on physical and emotional abuse on his part [ 223 ] and said she was high on ecstasy during their wedding ceremony. [ 224 ] Before her divorce was finalized, Kardashian began dating singer Ray J. [ 222 ] Kardashian then dated Reggie Bush . Their relationship began after Matt Leinart introduced them at the 2007 ESPY Awards . They split on July 27, 2009 [ 225 ] and got back together on September 28, 2009. [ 226 ] Kardashian also briefly dated NFL player Miles Austin in 2010. [ 227 ] In May 2011, Kardashian became engaged to NBA player Kris Humphries , then of the New Jersey Nets , whom she had been dating since October 2010. [ 228 ] They were married in a wedding ceremony on August 20 in Montecito, California . [ 229 ] Earlier that month, she had released her "wedding fragrance" called "Kim Kardashian Love" which coincided with her own wedding. [ 55 ] [ 230 ] A two-part TV special showing the preparations and the wedding itself aired on E! in early October 2011, amidst what The Washington Post called a "media blitz" related to the wedding. [ 231 ] After 72 days of marriage, she filed for divorce from Humphries on October 31, citing irreconcilable differences . [ 232 ] Several news outlets surmised that Kardashian''s marriage to Humphries was merely a publicity stunt to promote the Kardashian family''s brand and their subsequent television ventures. [ 233 ] A man professing to be her former publicist, Jonathan Jaxson, also claimed that her short-lived marriage was indeed staged and a ploy to generate money. Kardashian filed a suit against Jaxson, saying his claims were untrue, and later settled the case that included an apology from Jaxson. [ 234 ] A widely circulated petition asking to remove all Kardashian-related programming from the air followed the split. [ 235 ] The divorce was subject to w',
   '["clm_wiki_kim-kardashian_sec3"]', '["src_wikidata"]',
   'general', 'en', 'assisted', 'kp-027-migration-0027', 'auto_approved', 1,
