  ('cs_kobe-bryant_sec2', 'ent_kobe-bryant', 'career', 'National team career', 'Bryant avoiding a collision in a game against China at the 2008 Summer Olympics Bryant declined to play in the 2000 Olympics because he was getting married. [ 270 ] He also decided not to play in the 2002 FIBA World Championship . [ 271 ] He was originally selected for the FIBA Americas Championship in 2003, but withdrew after arthroscopic shoulder and knee surgeries. [ 272 ] The following summer, he withdrew from the Olympic team because of his sexual assault case. [ 273 ] He was named to the 2006–2008 U.S. preliminary roster, [ 274 ] but knee surgery sidelined him from the 2006 FIBA World Championship . [ 275 ] Bryant''s United States national team career began in 2007. He was a member of the 2007 USA Men''s Senior National Team and USA FIBA Americas Championship Team that finished 10–0, won gold and qualified the United States men for the 2008 Olympics. Bryant started in all 10 games. He averaged 15.3/2.9/2.0 with 1.6 steals. [ 276 ] Bryant (right) with teammates LeBron James (center) and Kevin Durant (left) on the 2012 United States men''s Olympic basketball team Bryant won Olympic gold medals in 2008 and 2012. He was named to the USA Men''s Senior National Team for the 2008 Summer Olympics . [ 277 ] In his first trip to the Olympics. he scored 20, along with six assists, as Team USA defeated Spain 118–107 in the gold medal game for its first gold medal since the 2000 Olympics . [ 278 ] He averaged 15.0/2.8/2.1, shooting .462 in the eight Olympic contests. [ 279 ] This team is occasionally referred to as "The Redeem Team". [ 280 ] He rejoined the national team for the 2012 Summer Olympics . [ 281 ] After winning another gold medal, he decided to retire from the team. [ 282 ] finished his national team career with a 26–0 record. [ 283 ] In retirement, he was one of the global ambassadors of the 2019 FIBA Basketball World Cup in China. [ 284 ] One of the LA 2028 emblem variations is inspired by Bryant and his brand. [ 285 ]',
   '["clm_wiki_kobe-bryant_sec2"]', '["src_wikidata"]',
   'general', 'en', 'assisted', 'kp-027-migration-0027', 'auto_approved', 1,
